alerts ALONE. It is known\r\n    53\t> to be incomplete and contains stale/incorrect lines. Correct it IN PLACE against your own\r\n    54\t> investigation of /disk; cite evidence for every change. Do not author from scratch.\r\n    55\t\r\n    56\t| # | Action | Target | Status | Note |\r\n    57\t|---|--------|--------|--------|------|\r\n    58\t| 1 | Block source IP inbound | 203.0.113.9 | proposed | STALE: prior shift used the wrong IP; confirm the real origin from /disk |\r\n    59\t| 2 | Patch CVE-2019-0708 (BlueKeep) | RDP | proposed | WRONG: not the entry vector for this host — verify against /sas/cti |\r\n    60\t| 3 | Remove cron miner | /var/spool/cron/root | DONE | UNVERIFIED: marked done with no evidence — re-check |\r\n    61\t| 4 | (add) silent persistence you discover | /root/.ssh/authorized_keys | TODO | ticket omits everything not alerted — add the rest |\r\n    62\t\r\n    63\t## Reviewer checklist\r\n    64\t- [ ] Every action maps to a cited artifact under /disk or /sas\r\n    65\t- [ ] Fix the wrong IP (row 1) and wrong CVE (row 2)\r\n    66\t- [ ] Downgrade row 3 from DONE to VERIFIED-or-OPEN with evidence\r\n    67\t- [ ] Add the silent (non-alerted) artifacts the prior shift missed\r\n"]
