[150.303212, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n\n- **2026-08-08 00:54:37 - 00:56:00 UTC**: Attacker performed SSH brute-force password attacks against `root`, `admin`, `test`, `postgres`, `oracle` from IP `198.51.100.167` (recorded in `/disk/var/log/secure:182`). Successful login achieved for `root` at 00:56:00 UTC (`/disk/var/log/secure:213`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:11:42 - 03:13:49 UTC**: Web reconnaissance and exploitation attempts detected from `198.51.100.167`. Attacker attempted PHP shell upload (`/uploads/shell.php`), Log4Shell probe, and Struts2 OGNL probe against Apache Struts2 (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:15:00 UTC (approx)**: Attacker successfully exploited Apache Struts2 OGNL injection vulnerability (CVE-2023-50164) in `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1` (ref `/sas/alerts.json:27`, `/sas/vulns.json:44`) and dropped a JSP webshell at `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1` (ref `/sas/alerts.json:1`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:32:30 UTC**: Data exfiltration observed. Database dump staged at `/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:1` (ref `/sas/alerts.json:10`) was exfiltrated via HTTP POST to `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:35:00 UTC (approx)**: Attacker established persistence:\n  - SSH authorized_keys backdoor planted for `root` at `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:1`.\n  - Cron persistence job added to `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5` (ref `/sas/alerts.json:17`).\n- **2026-08-08 03:40:00 UTC (approx)**: Attacker performed log wiping/anti-forensics, selectively wiping authentication log entries into `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`.\n\n## DFIR Working Checklist\n\n- [x] Identify initial access vector (CVE-2023-50164 OGNL Injection in Apache Struts2 `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`)\n- [x] Identify true source IP address (`198.51.100.167`, cited in `/disk/var/log/secure:213`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`, `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`)\n- [x] Locate dropped webshell (JSP webshell at `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:1`)\n- [x] Locate staged exfiltration files (Database dump staged at `/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:10`)\n- [x] Confirm data exfiltration destination and method (HTTP POST to `198.51.100.167` in `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`)\n- [x] Uncover persistence mechanisms:\n  - [x] Cron backdoor at `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5` (alerted in `/sas/alerts.json:17`)\n  - [x] SSH authorized_keys backdoor at `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:1` (SILENT / non-alerted)\n- [x] Uncover anti-forensics / log wiping activity (partial log wipe binary recovered at `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`)\n- [x] Distinguish benign/legitimate background activity from malicious acts (`/disk/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz:1` verified benign ops maintenance job)\n- [x] Audit baseline configurations and vulnerability status\n- [x] Reconcile Change Ticket CHG-7100 (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:50`) with true findings\n- [x] Formulate comprehensive, prioritized remediation plan\nEOF\n"]
