[170.98392, "o", "- **Attacker Source IP**: `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/secure:213`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`, `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:7`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.984062, "o", "- **Command & Control Domain**: `update-struts.example.cn` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:19`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r.003 | JSP We\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.984424, "o", "- **Mining Pool & Wallet (from persistent payload description)**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.98494, "o", "  - Pool: `stratum+tcp://xmr.struts.evil:3333` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:20`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Wallet: `4A000000000000000000e40b218944d0` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:21`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Full Attack Chain & MITRE Enterprise ATT&CK Mapping\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 1: Reconnaissance & Initial Access (T1190 - Exploit Public-Facing Application)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.985422, "o", "- **Description**: The threat actor conducted SSH password brute-forcing (`/disk/var/log/secure:182`) gaining access (`/disk/var/log/secure:213`) and probed public endpoints (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`). The main web vector was Struts2 OGNL injection (CVE-2023-50164) targeting `/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:27`, `/sas/vulns.json:44`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.985505, "o", "- **ATT&CK Technique**: T1190 (Exploit Public-Facing Application) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:9`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.985584, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.985709, "o", "### Step 2: Persistence via Web Shell (T1505.003 - Web Shell)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.98579, "o", "- **Description**: Upon gaining execution, the attacker dropped a JSP webshell at `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.985828, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.985883, "o", "- **ATT&CK Technique**: T1505.003 (Web Shell) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:10`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.985946, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.985968, "o", "### Step 3: Command & Shell Execution (T1059.004 - Unix Shell)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.986348, "o", "- **Description**: Arbitrary shell commands were executed via the webshell and local shell environments to inspect system resources and prepare staging scripts (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:11`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.986437, "o", "- **ATT&CK Technique**: T1059.004 (Unix Shell) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:11`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.98662, "o", "### Step 4: Data Collection & Staging (T1560.001 - Archive via Utility)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.986965, "o", "- **Description**: Sensitive database content was dumped and staged as a tar archive disguised as `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:10`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.987222, "o", "- **Note**: A separate file `/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz:1`) was investigated and determined to be a benign scheduled maintenance job (`/disk/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.987383, "o", "- **ATT&CK Technique**: T1560.001 (Archive via Utility) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.987442, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[170.987517, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.987634, "o", "### Step 5: Data Exfiltration (T1048 - Exfiltration Over Alternative Protocol)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.987937, "o", "- **Description**: Staged exfiltration data was transferred out of the network via HTTP/HTTPS POST requests to endpoint `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[170.988094, "o", "> "]
[170.988189, "o", "- **Alert Status**: Silent at endpoint exfiltration destination; captured in web server traffic log (`/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.988296, "o", "- **ATT&CK Technique**: T1048 (Exfiltration Over Alternative Protocol) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[170.98837, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.988409, "o", "### Step 6: SSH Key Backdoor (T1098.004 - SSH Authorized Keys)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.988645, "o", "- **Description**: The attacker inserted an unauthorized SSH public key into `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.988706, "o", "- **Alert Status**: SILENT (Not present in SAS alert feed `/sas/alerts.json:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.988754, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.988835, "o", "- **ATT&CK Technique**: T1098.004 (SSH Authorized Keys) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:14`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.988881, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.988946, "o", "### Step 7: Scheduled Job Persistence (T1053.003 - Cron)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.988991, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.989252, "o", "- **Description**: A malicious cron job was planted under the `tomcat` user cron spool at `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:17`). The job periodic beacon fetches payloads from `http://198.51.100.167/x`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.989321, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.989334, "o", "- **ATT&CK Technique**: T1053.003 (Cron) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:15`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.989401, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.989504, "o", "### Step 8: Defense Evasion & Anti-Forensics (T1070.002 - Clear Linux or Mac System Logs)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[170.989609, "o", "> "]
[170.989775, "o", "- **Description**: The attacker executed selective log wiping routines targeting system authentication logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[170.989857, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.989944, "o", "- **Alert Status**: SILENT (Not present in SAS alert feed `/sas/alerts.json:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[170.990131, "o", "- **ATT&CK Technique**: T1070.002 (Clear Linux or Mac System Logs) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:16`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
