[212.020397, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[212.020421, "o", "> 1. **Remove Backdoor SSH Keys**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[212.020481, "o", "> "]
[212.020852, "o", "   - Action: Backup and clean `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:1`), removing the attacker's public key.\r\n"]
