[212.021575, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>    - Verification: Confirm `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` contains only approved administrative keys.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **Remove Malicious Cron Job**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Action: Backup `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`) and remove line 5 containing the curl beacon (`http://198.51.100.167/x`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Verification: Run `crontab -u tomcat -l` and ensure no unauthorized jobs remain.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[212.0218, "o", "3. **Quarantine Staged Exfiltration File**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[212.02214, "o", "   - Action: Move `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:1`) to secure forensic storage (`/var/quarantine/dump.tar.gz.bak`). Note that `/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/backup.tar.gz:1`) is a legitimate ops maintenance job and must NOT be removed.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
