[212.02335, "o", "### Phase 3: Vulnerability Remediation & Hardening (Medium Priority)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Upgrade Apache Struts2**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Action: Upgrade `/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`) to a patched version per vendor advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:23`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Verification: Verify Struts2 library version and perform regression testing on web application.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **SSH Configuration Hardening**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Action: Disable SSH password authentication and direct `root` login in `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` (`/disk/var/log/secure:182`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Verification: Test SSH access using public key authentication only.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 4: Recovery & Monitoring (Ongoing)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Centralized Log Forwarding**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Action: Configure rsyslog/syslog-ng to forward audit and authentication logs offsite to prevent unmonitored log wiping (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Verification: Confirm log ingestion on SIEM / central syslog server.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
